{"site":"douban","sid":"1393859","imdb_id":"tt0108778","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0108778/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1393859/","chinese_title":"老友记 第一季","foreign_title":"Friends Season 1","year":"1994","aka":["F·R·I·E·N·D·S","Six of One","六人行 第一季","都市六人行 第一季"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["喜剧","爱情"],"language":["英语","荷兰语","汉语普通话"],"playdate":["1994-09-22(美国)"],"episodes":"24","duration":"22分钟 / 30分钟(未删减版)","description":"莫妮卡（柯特妮·考克斯 ）、钱德勒（马修·派瑞）、瑞秋（詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）、菲比（莉莎·库卓）、乔伊（马特·理勃兰）和罗斯（大卫·休谟）是彼此最好的朋友，一起走过十年岁月的点点滴滴。虽然老友们各有各的性格特点，也会有矛盾和争执，但对于彼此，他们永远be there for you.\n故事开始在Central Perk咖啡馆里，婚礼上落荒而逃的瑞秋闯进来寻找老同学莫妮卡。莫妮卡的哥哥刚刚离婚，而他从小暗恋的人正是这个落跑新娘瑞秋。瑞秋在莫妮卡家住了下来，决定不再做爸爸的女孩儿，真正的步入社会，于是在其他老友的帮助下，她上路了，从二十多岁初入社会，到三十多岁成家立业，他们一走就是十年。\n十年间风风雨雨，在嬉笑怒骂中，在离别团聚中，他们向我们讲述着友情、爱情还有生活。让我们和他们一起开怀大笑或是黯然神伤。","poster":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2186920269.jpg","douban_votes":"410243","douban_rating":"9.7","imdb_rating_average":"8.8","imdb_votes":"1195654","imdb_rating":"8.8 / 10 from 1,195,654 users","director":[{"name":"大卫·克拉尼 David Crane","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27276150/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p31021.webp"},{"name":"玛尔塔·考夫曼 Marta Kauffman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27255880/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1358402895.57.webp"},{"name":"帕梅拉·福莱曼 Pamela Fryman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27512558/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1355946758.51.webp"},{"name":"阿兰尼·珊福德 Arlene Sanford","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27565994/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"彼得·博内兹 Peter Bonerz","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27231113/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public